# Expanded Object Literal Style

- For pairs like `title` + `description`, always use expanded multiline formatting:
  - `basics: {`
  - `  title: 'Basis',`
  - `  description: 'Kernsyntax van Markdown voor bijna elk document.',`
  - `},`
- Do not collapse these objects into one line, even when short.
- Apply this style consistently in locale files and similar user-facing copy maps.
